@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
@prefix hpc: <http://example.org/hpc#>

hpc:Usergroup a owl:Class.
hpc:Keyuser a owl:Class.

hpc:Hasusergroup rdfs:domain hpc:User; rdfs:range hpc:Usergroup.

hpc:Queue a owl:Class.
hpc:Queuename rdfs:domain hpc:Queue; rdfs:range xsd:string.

hpc:Fairshare rdfs:domain hpc:Queue; rdfs:range rdf:List.
hpc:fairShare rdfs:subPropertyOf hpc:hasUserGroup.

hpc:Usershare a owl:Class.
hpc:Usersh
